#. Translators: Same as the Ctrl+Win+I fourth-press case, spoken here by the F2 dialog equivalent.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\trackInfoMixin.py:315
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\trackInfoMixin.py:410
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\trackInfoMixin.py:600
